{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras/2526cf30603912eccc86ec850dec0662.avif?t=1767697906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras_big/2526cf30603912eccc86ec850dec0662.webp?t=1767697906 width=1560 height=1170 /></span><strong><i>Step into a world of breathtaking nature\u2026</i></strong><i> and watch it slowly unravel. As you journey through beauty and ruin, a single question follows you: who is destroying this place? Explore, uncover memories, and face the truth hidden just beyond the last photograph.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture the world\u2019s beauty.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From quiet rivers and deep forests to distant mountains glowing beneath the night sky \u2014 every photo you take reveals another piece of this living world and hints at the truth it hides.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras/55d6f4e10736f2f6752995d6c6697950.avif?t=1767697906\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relive your journey.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Revisit the photos in your album \u2014 the calm forests, falling light, and fragile details you might\u2019ve missed. Each image becomes a memory\u2026 and a reminder of how easily beauty can fade.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras/a821afc7efb2c68b07db05e3cd301726.avif?t=1767697906\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witness the cost of carelessness.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Watch the world shift as even small actions leave lasting scars \u2014 forests fade, rivers darken, and silence replaces life. What begins as wonder slowly becomes a warning.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115790?t=1767697906","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115790?t=1767697906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/1ca0600644e63fe448eeeba1b958b4e91d369c98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767697906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/1ca0600644e63fe448eeeba1b958b4e91d369c98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767697906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras/2526cf30603912eccc86ec850dec0662.avif?t=1767697906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras_big/2526cf30603912eccc86ec850dec0662.webp?t=1767697906 width=1560 height=1170 /></span><strong><i>Step into a world of breathtaking nature\u2026</i></strong><i> and watch it slowly unravel. As you jo